  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation, separating sensing (uncontrollable) and motion (controllable) events. The specification enforces safe, conservative obstacle recovery and strong bias toward forward exploration, ensuring only one controllable is enabled per state, and that recovery states are used after obstacles. Full rotation is reserved for repeated or unrecoverable blockages.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion to reflect open-loop actuation and sensor-driven transitions.",
